    "DAY 8"
   ],
   "text": "Day eight. It's quiet when you're the only one breathing.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "scene": "dead_phone",
   "start": 5.41,
   "speech_end": 8.45,
   "end": 9.45,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Your phone died two days ago. You still check it.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "scene": "locker",
   "start": 9.45,
   "speech_end": 15.19,
   "end": 16.19,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "In Ray's locker. A spare vest. A photo of a young man in a hard hat. And a CB radio.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "scene": "cb",
   "start": 16.19,
   "speech_end": 21.77,
   "end": 22.57,
   "overlay": [
    "time",
    "CH 19"
   ],
   "text": "Truckers use channel nineteen. Ray told you that on day one.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "scene": "cb_knob",
   "start": 22.57,
   "speech_end": 27.4,
   "end": 28.4,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You keep the volume low. Rule one says no lights. It says nothing about sound.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "scene": "cb_mic",
   "start": 28.4,
   "speech_end": 32.62,
   "end": 34.02,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You press the button, and say the only thing you can think of. Is anyone out there?",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "scene": "cb_wait",
   "start": 34.02,
   "speech_end": 36.92,
   "end": 39.72,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Nothing. For an hour, nothing.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "scene": "cb_live",
   "start": 39.72,
   "speech_end": 43.78,
   "end": 44.58,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Hello? Hello! Is somebody actually there?",
   "role": "dani"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "scene": "cb_live",
   "start": 44.58,
   "speech_end": 51.81,
   "end": 52.81,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "I'm Dani. I'm at the Starlight Motel, mile marker one-thirty. It's me and my little brother, Milo.",
   "role": "dani"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "scene": "map",
   "start": 52.81,
   "speech_end": 57.78,
   "end": 58.78,
   "overlay": [
    "count",
    "3",
    "MILES NORTH"
   ],
   "text": "Three miles north. An hour on foot. Forever in the dark.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "scene": "cb_live",
   "start": 58.78,
   "speech_end": 62.7,
   "end": 63.7,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "We have a car. No gas. Please tell me you have gas.",
   "role": "dani"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "scene": "pumps_dark",
   "start": 63.7,
   "speech_end": 66.02,
   "end": 67.22,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You're sitting on top of twelve thousand gallons of it.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "scene": "cb_live",
   "start": 67.22,
   "speech_end": 72.84,
   "end": 73.84,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Dawn is safest. They go slow when it's cold. Meet us at dawn. Day after tomorrow.",
   "role": "dani"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "scene": "napkin",
   "start": 73.84,
   "speech_end": 77.66,
   "end": 78.66,
   "overlay": [
    "rule",
    "RULE 5:",
    "MOVE ONLY AT DAWN"
   ],
   "text": "Rule five, you write on a napkin. Move only at dawn.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "scene": "sleep_cb",
   "start": 78.66,
   "speech_end": 83.89,
   "end": 85.49,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "That night, you sleep with the radio on your chest. Channel nineteen, hissing softly.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "scene": "draft",
   "start": 85.49,
   "speech_end": 87.33,
   "end": 88.53,
   "overlay": [
    "time",
    "DAY 9 - 4:02 AM"
   ],
   "text": "At four AM, a cold draft wakes you.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "scene": "storeroom",
   "start": 88.53,
   "speech_end": 91.63,
   "end": 92.83,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "It's coming from the storeroom. From behind the walk-in.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "scene": "dock_open",
   "start": 92.83,
   "speech_end": 96.4,
   "end": 98.0,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Walk-in coolers have two doors. You only ever locked one.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "scene": "cooler_empty",
   "start": 98.0,
   "speech_end": 104.07,
   "end": 105.47,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "The cooler is empty. Ray's crossword sits on a crate. Folded. Like he's coming back to finish it.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "scene": "footprints",
